Process-metric self-test case: cli-run-arm-not-in-config

Kind: cli (bun score/preflight.ts run), PILOT_CONFIG = pilot-02/config.env (ARMS B E)

Scenario
preflight.ts run mode is asked to check arm C, which pilot-02 does not have. batch, p2 and run/run-one.sh already refuse
an arm outside the config's ARMS; run mode called armOf without the config's arms and accepted it.

Expected
Exit 2 (usage error) with "arm C is not in the config's ARMS (B E)" before any file is read, so the paths need not exist.
